------------------------------------------------------
TEd 
Text Editor for Rumbledethumps' Picocomputer 6502
------------------------------------------------------

* press and hold [F1] for TEd's keysology

* simple invocation with new document:
  ]load ted.rp6502

* for some detailed information:
  ]load ted.rp6502 /manual

* for sample text:
  ]load ted.rp6502 /sample

* to open with your document:
  ]load ted.rp6502 path_to_your_document

* to open with your document in view (read-only) mode:
  ]load ted.rp6502 path_to_your_document /view
------------------------------------------------------
